WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:26.500
[Extended Live Arena Intro: Shredding 16-Bit Chiptune Arpeggios & Stadium Crowd Roar]

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:31.500
I was tired of the chaos, I was sick of all the noise

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:37.550
The messy little glitches of these human girls and boys

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:43.700
But a kingdom needs a ruler with an iron-coded fist

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:52.000
To systematically delete the names upon his list!

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:57.900
They thought they could outplay me, how delightfully naive

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:03.800
I'm weaving purple runes that they could not begin to weave!

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:06.600
By the power of the Grand Decree!

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:10.500
The Dream Kingdom belongs to me!

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:13.600
Every pixel, every byte, will surrender to the night

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:19.000
When I rewrite the entire directory!

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:26.000
Oh, bow to the Grand Decree!

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:37.000
[Instrumental Interlude: Chiptune Synth Lead & Driving Double-Kick Drums]

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:39.680
I have taken the apprentice, I have bent his little mind

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:42.600
I've severed all the messy little ties he left behind

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:45.400
When the ceremony finishes, the glitch will be erased

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:50.500
And a perfect, flawless order will be finally embraced!

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:53.200
There is nowhere left to hide inside this crumbling domain

00:02:53.200 --> 00:03:01.500
I will format every memory and rule the silent rain!

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:05.700
By the power of the Grand Decree!

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:10.500
The Dream Kingdom belongs to me!

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:13.550
Every pixel, every byte, will surrender to the night

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:17.500
When I rewrite the entire directory!

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:25.000
Oh, bow to the Grand Decree!

00:03:25.000 --> 00:04:14.200
[Guitar & Chiptune Solo: Blistering 16-Bit Arpeggio Sweep-Picking & Heavy Breakdown]

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:17.800
Look at the peasants, trembling down below

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:21.300
They cling to the light, but the light has to go!

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:24.750
Their messy emotions, their analog tears

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:31.800
Will be swept from the server and erased from the years!

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:40.000
Fools... they think a simple medallion can stop me?

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:46.800
Yes, bow!

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:53.000
To the Grand Decree!

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:57.000
[Outro: Explosive Chiptune Synth Finale & Final Power Chord]
